I'm pleased to announce hledger 1.99.5 (2.0 preview 5): the fastest
hledger yet, with UI translations, find-anywhere query, compact transactions report,
lossless print --export, CSV merge rule, includable CSV & rules files,
gains at cost basis, short positions, auto-updating hledger-ui,
hledger-web balance reports, paging and dark mode.
By using it you'll help make 2.0 better!

